5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I hate walking past the corner in August. It smells terrible.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I agree, Rin. But we need to know the costs first.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,We are still neighbours. Let's not make this awkward.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,"Who is actually doing the work? I want hours, not promises.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,One house has suffered for years. We need fairness.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@May, what kind of hours are we talking about?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Asuka, fairness is good, but budgets vary a lot here.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, if it's just supervision, it might be manageable.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, manageable for whom? I've seen this before.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Midori, I am not asking for charity, just equal burden.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,I just want it to stop smelling like a swamp.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Midori,,Let's look at the ledger and the subsidy options.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will check what the ward actually requires for changes.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,I need to know the time commitment for any plan.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will look at the complaint log to see the history.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
