35,2,1,talk,Rin,,I visited the station block's bin house. It smells worse inside.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Midori,,The ledger shows thirty-four thousand yen a year in extra fees.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,Filing a permanent build takes four months and five signatures.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,The truck arrives at seven forty. That is before I wake up.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Asuka,,The complaint log shows eleven entries from the gate household.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@May, if the truck comes early, who is up to watch?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shunichi, four months is a long time to wait for a fix.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, the station block argued about sweeping within two years.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"@Asuka, so the gate household is the most affected?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Midori, the subsidy only covers forty percent. We pay the rest.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Rin,,I don't want to be the one sweeping a smelly box.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Midori,,We need to split the remaining sixty percent of the cost.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"If we rotate locations, we avoid the permanent build delay.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,Rotating means moving bins every few months. That is work.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Asuka,,Rotating ensures no single house bears the gate burden.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
