60,3,1,talk,Rin,,"Option B, rotating, seems best. No permanent smell trap.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Midori,,"Option A is cheaper, but the early hours are brutal.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,Option C is too slow. Option B keeps us moving.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,May,,Option A requires waking up at seven. I cannot do that.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Asuka,,Option B is the only one that is truly equal.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Rin,,"@May, I agree. I don't want to wake up early either.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shunichi, rotating might be tiring, but it is fair.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Asuka, yes, and it avoids the four-month wait.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,May,,"@Rin, let's go with B. I can handle moving bins.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Midori, the cost is lower than building a shelter.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
